ough because it explicitly lists supported units and obviously `bytes` are not listed.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/issues/comments/458543689/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"darth-hp","id":13313834,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMzEzODM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13313834?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darth-hp","html_url":"https://github.com/darth-hp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darth-hp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darth-hp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darth-hp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darth-hp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darth-hp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darth-hp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darth-hp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darth-hp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darth-hp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/issues/comments/458565751","html_url":"https://github.com/prometheus/prometheus/issues/5142#issuecomment-458565751","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/issues/5142","id":458565751,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ1ODU2NTc1MQ==","user":{"login":"acdha","id":46565,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46565?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/acdha","html_url":"https://github.com/acdha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acdha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acdha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acdha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acdha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acdha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acdha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acdha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acdha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acdha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-01-29T14:45:14Z","updated_at":"2019-01-29T14:45:14Z","body":"@hphde bytes are specified as the base unit in the previous sentence and most tools assume you're providing that value directly unless otherwise specified. For example, `dd` has this:\r\n\r\n> BLOCKS and BYTES may be followed by the following multiplicative suffixes: c =1, w =2, b =512, kB =1000, K =1024, MB =1000*1000, M =1024*1024, xM =M GB =1000*1000*1000, G =1024*1024*1024, and so on for T, P, E, Z, Y. \r\n\r\nPerhaps that's really an argument saying that “unit” is the wrong term — the GNU utilities generally use “multiplicative suffix”:\r\n\r\n> Put size bytes of input into each output file. size may be, or may be an integer optionally followed by, one of the following multiplicative suffixes: …\r\n\r\nhttps://www.gnu.org/software/coreutils/manual/html_node/split-invocation.html\r\n\r\n> A block size specification can be a positive integer specifying the number of bytes per block, or it can be human-readable or si to select a human-readable format. Integers may be followed by suffixes that are upward compatible with the SI prefixes for decimal multiples and with the ISO/IEC 80000-13 (formerly IEC 60027-2) prefixes for binary multiples. \r\n\r\nhttps://www.gnu.org/software/coreutils/manual/html_node/Block-size.html#Block-size","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/issues/comments/458565751/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"acdha","id":46565,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46565?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/acdha","html_url":"https://github.com/acdha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acdha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acdha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acdha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acdha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acdha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acdha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acdha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acdha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/acdha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":2103841404,"node_id":"MDE0Ok1lbnRpb25lZEV2ZW50MjEwMzg0MTQwNA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/prometheus/prometheus/issues/events/2103841404","actor":{"login":"darth-hp","id":13313834,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzMzEzODM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13313834?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darth-hp","html_url":"https://github.com/darth-hp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darth-hp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darth-hp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darth-hp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darth-hp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darth-hp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darth-hp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darth-hp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darth-hp/ev